{% comment %}
  Google Business lookup — attaches live business search to the store's
  existing "Add Google Details" inputs (.detail-input).

  Rendered once from layout/theme.liquid. It does not add any fields of its
  own: it fills the input the theme already collects into the Profile N line
  item property, so existing validation and cart logic are untouched.

  No Google API key here, and there must never be one — anything Liquid renders
  is readable in page source. Lookups go to the endpoint below, which holds the
  key server-side and only answers approved storefront domains.
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign lookup_endpoint = 'https://www.tapandrateai.co.uk' -%}
{%- assign restrict_to_country = 'GB' -%}

<script>
  window.TapAndRateBusinessLookup = {
    proxyUrl: {{ lookup_endpoint | strip | json }},
    country: {{ restrict_to_country | strip | downcase | json }},
    minChars: 3,
    selector: ".detail-input"
  };
</script>
{{ 'google-business-lookup.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'google-business-lookup.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
